    "problems": "The study reports ASR averaged over 3 trials but gives no uncertainty estimates. The text does not specify per-model numerical outcomes for the Figure 10 generalization results. The paper notes that its layerwise analysis does not account for cross-layer interactions, that it did not assess long-term behavior, and that its dataset focuses on text-based attacks.",
    "rows_left_out": "No rows omitted for the 60-row limit. Parameter-distribution statistics and S_score were used to select layers and are not behavioral outcomes; resource-use values do not measure the claim versions.",
