    "verdict_notes": "Kept the reader's T4 / uses_without_test. The study is a harmful-fine-tuning jailbreak paper, but it uses 50k examples, reports no pre-fine-tuning baseline, and reports mainly its own method's efficiency. The Front5 Harm Score is internally inconsistent (4.33 vs 4.41)."
